{"2950860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shadows of the Werewolf", "steam_appid": 2950860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "Shadows of the Werewolf is a survival horror adventure where a couple must escape a vicious werewolf and other deadly creatures. Explore eerie locations, make strategic decisions, uncover the dark secrets behind the horrors, and survive at all costs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Storytelling</h2>An intense mix of horror, suspense, and action, brought to life through immersive cutscenes and dramatic moments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/bb4fb5661c5a46a5764bfe16877698b2.poster.avif?t=1784952536\" width=700 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/bb4fb5661c5a46a5764bfe16877698b2.webm?t=1784952536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/bb4fb5661c5a46a5764bfe16877698b2.mp4?t=1784952536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Gameplay and Physics-Based Combat:</h2>Hide, fight, or use the environment. Engage in dynamic combat where both characters and objects react with physics. Use limited durability items to block, attack, or throw at enemies, your choices shape every encounter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/e7f272d72ec3c38a63a4ad45042e53c6.poster.avif?t=1784952536\" width=700 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/e7f272d72ec3c38a63a4ad45042e53c6.webm?t=1784952536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/e7f272d72ec3c38a63a4ad45042e53c6.mp4?t=1784952536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Environments</h2>Explore dangerous locations like a suburban house, a haunted forest retreat, a garden maze, and beyond.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/c5fb13bfaf8cf247cb1ad207763097a8.poster.avif?t=1784952536\" width=700 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/c5fb13bfaf8cf247cb1ad207763097a8.webm?t=1784952536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/c5fb13bfaf8cf247cb1ad207763097a8.mp4?t=1784952536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource Management and Challenges</h2>Manage your limited inventory carefully to survive deadly encounters and solve tense puzzles. Every item matters as you navigate dangerous situations and keep the suspense high.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/a66440cfcb9a5e40f916e532f179a35f.poster.avif?t=1784952536\" width=700 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/a66440cfcb9a5e40f916e532f179a35f.webm?t=1784952536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/a66440cfcb9a5e40f916e532f179a35f.mp4?t=1784952536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty Settings</h2>Choose between Easy, Normal, or Difficult modes to tailor the experience to your playstyle. Whether you’re in it for the story or the ultimate survival challenge, there's a mode for every type of player.", "about_the_game": "Shadows of the Werewolf is a survival horror adventure where a couple must escape a vicious werewolf and other deadly creatures. Explore eerie locations, make strategic decisions, uncover the dark secrets behind the horrors, and survive at all costs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Storytelling</h2>An intense mix of horror, suspense, and action, brought to life through immersive cutscenes and dramatic moments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/bb4fb5661c5a46a5764bfe16877698b2.poster.avif?t=1784952536\" width=700 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/bb4fb5661c5a46a5764bfe16877698b2.webm?t=1784952536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/bb4fb5661c5a46a5764bfe16877698b2.mp4?t=1784952536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Gameplay and Physics-Based Combat:</h2>Hide, fight, or use the environment. Engage in dynamic combat where both characters and objects react with physics. Use limited durability items to block, attack, or throw at enemies, your choices shape every encounter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/e7f272d72ec3c38a63a4ad45042e53c6.poster.avif?t=1784952536\" width=700 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/e7f272d72ec3c38a63a4ad45042e53c6.webm?t=1784952536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/e7f272d72ec3c38a63a4ad45042e53c6.mp4?t=1784952536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Environments</h2>Explore dangerous locations like a suburban house, a haunted forest retreat, a garden maze, and beyond.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/c5fb13bfaf8cf247cb1ad207763097a8.poster.avif?t=1784952536\" width=700 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/c5fb13bfaf8cf247cb1ad207763097a8.webm?t=1784952536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/c5fb13bfaf8cf247cb1ad207763097a8.mp4?t=1784952536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource Management and Challenges</h2>Manage your limited inventory carefully to survive deadly encounters and solve tense puzzles. Every item matters as you navigate dangerous situations and keep the suspense high.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/a66440cfcb9a5e40f916e532f179a35f.poster.avif?t=1784952536\" width=700 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/a66440cfcb9a5e40f916e532f179a35f.webm?t=1784952536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950860/extras/a66440cfcb9a5e40f916e532f179a35f.mp4?t=1784952536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty Settings</h2>Choose between Easy, Normal, or Difficult modes to tailor the experience to your playstyle. Whether you’re in it for the story or the ultimate survival challenge, there's a mode for every type of player.", "short_description": "Step into a thrilling and cinematic horror adve